<div class="bg-gray-50 min-h-screen py-24 px-4">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <span class="text-[#E30613] font-black tracking-widest uppercase text-xs mb-4 block">Support</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-6 tracking-tight">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-500 font-medium text-lg">Everything you need to know about the product and billing.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6">
      <!-- FAQ Item 1 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-3">Does it really clean as well as liquid detergent?</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 font-medium leading-relaxed">Yes! Our sheets are ultra-concentrated. We removed the water and kept all the active plant-based enzymes that lift stains and eliminate odors. In independent blind tests, E-strip performed identically to leading liquid brands.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ Item 2 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-3">Is it safe for sensitive skin?</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 font-medium leading-relaxed">Absolutely. We use a hypoallergenic formula free of parabens, phosphates, added dyes, and chlorine bleach. It's gentle enough for baby clothes and those with sensitive skin.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ Item 3 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-3">How does the subscription work?</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 font-medium leading-relaxed">When you subscribe, you save 15% on every order. We automatically ship you a fresh pack based on the frequency you choose (every 1, 2, or 3 months). You can easily skip, pause, or cancel anytime from your account dashboard.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="mt-16 text-center">
      <p class="text-gray-500 font-medium mb-6">Still have questions?</p>
      <a href="/pages/contact" class="btn bg-gray-900 text-white hover:bg-[#E30613] px-10 py-4 rounded-[9999px] font-bold text-sm tracking-widest shadow-lg inline-block">Contact Support</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FAQ Page",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
